#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/draft-to-publication.bpmn:72
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns the approved/not-approved gateway: it fires after Lane_Sme's sign-off has also reached the join, but the call is this lane's alone, and a rejection becomes the change beans Lane_WorkPlan opens next."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/draft-to-publication.bpmn:50
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns the one gate that decides whether the draft is fit to be circulated: Task_BuildDraft turns the corpus into a draft and the DMN-backed Gateway_QaGreen decides whether Task_CirculateDraft runs, so a red draft never reaches Lane_ReviewTeam or Lane_Sme."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/draft-to-publication.bpmn:240
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanClose: end the bean in a state that says why — complete and archive it, scrap it with its reasons and archive it, or record the blocker and hand it back. The one place resolve and archive are drawn; placed straight before the end so the engine's resolve sees nothing left but the archive step."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/draft-to-publication.bpmn:94
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before you create, find out whose the bean is, and claim it — or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The one place a claim is drawn; the gateway after this reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

