#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Render the corpus into the draft form of the folio: PDF, HTML site, or FHIR IG."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/draft-to-publication.bpmn:71
#. Diagram label
msgid "Review team (content · QC · technical officer)"
msgstr ""

